{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264IheuCkMw51793597325.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本購物「先付後退」新退稅制度現已實施，旅客需在機場完成手續。以往旅客在免稅店購物，消費總額達未含稅5,000日圓或以上，可直接扣稅結帳。<br/><br/>新制下，旅客先支付含百分之10消費稅的價格，並於指定退稅平台登記收款信用卡或賬戶，離境前在機場辦理退稅。東京部分商店已貼出告示，提醒旅客新安排。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203105-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%85%88%E4%BB%98%E5%BE%8C%E9%80%80%E5%85%8D%E7%A8%85%E6%96%B0%E5%88%B611%E6%9C%88%E8%B5%B7%E5%AF%A6%E6%96%BD%E9%80%80%E7%A8%85%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9B%A1%E8%A6%BD%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E7%86%B1%E8%A9%B1%E9%99%84%E5%BD%B1%E7%89%87%E4%BB%8B%E7%B4%B9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>日本「先付後退」免稅新制11月起實施　退稅流程重點一文盡覽｜網絡熱話‧附影片介紹</strong></a></p><p></p><p>有本港旅行社表示，整體過關流程暢順。新制實施後，旅客須預留時間在機場辦理退稅手續，旅行社的實際經驗顯示流程運作正常。</p><p></p><p>不少旅客關注新退稅制度下，各家商店及退稅平台所收取的手續費差異。本文綜合網上資料，列出主要商家的退稅手續費，供讀者參閱比較。<br/></p><p><strong><em>*由於未有統一平台公布相關收費，同一商家的不同分店亦可能有異，收費按現場所見為準。</em></strong></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"tax-form1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qGr21iSpAl1793596747.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"tax-form2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026n5rIFB0pvD1793596774.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"tax-form3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026O4ArhcQKCE1793596801.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另一方面，由於未有統一平台發布收費訊息，各店家在手續費方面的處理仍存在不確定性。例如，有網民在使用J-TaxRefund的店家發現，手續費高達7.8%，連同匯率差額計算，幾乎等於「退了等於沒退」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7.8fee.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026m0tb0lb3KU1793596961.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有關注人士指出，大多店家退稅手續費介乎0-3%之間，意即客戶可以退回7-10%。懷疑可能是店家誤會貼錯，若然手續費為2.2%則屬正常水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:21:47.490317+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":516,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T22:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.663768+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:19:12.683256+00:00","content_hash":"42e74c16b258e3d7089281a527f9ed6bb113fb0d191e5fc7b90a45bd5ad7384d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:21:47.490317+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}